---
title: Documentation
---

LogIt is an offline-first, self-hostable workout and nutrition tracker. This is
the technical documentation.

## Sections

- **[Self-hosting](/self-hosting)** — run your own LogIt backend.
- **[Plugins](/docs/plugins)** — build and share progression algorithms,
  nutrition algorithms, analytics modules, home-screen widgets, and exercise
  packs. Everything runs in a sandbox; nothing you install can touch your data
  or the network.

## Source

Everything is on [GitHub](https://github.com/Martin-Melody/LogIt). The app is
SvelteKit + Capacitor; shared logic lives in `@logit/core`.
